  "en": "Trucks, buses, generator sets, farm and marine diesel engines (SAE J1939, FMS): engine speed, torque, temperatures, oil pressure and level, fuel rate and economy, vehicle speed, battery voltage, engine hours.",
  "zh-Hant": "卡車、巴士、發電機組、農機與船用柴油引擎（SAE J1939、FMS）：轉速、扭矩、各種溫度、機油壓力與油位、油耗、車速、電瓶電壓、運轉時數。"
 },
 "bitrate": 250000,
